            "created_at": "2025-09-17T02:39:57.598686+00:00",
            "notes": "This round is a little different as we now have [Flash Fist](item_418a92bd-1b45-4135-aca0-682d3c7a845b) which scales off ability power. I've found tracer is still very strong even without going all into weapon power so splitting some into ability makes [Flash Fist](item_418a92bd-1b45-4135-aca0-682d3c7a845b) very strong at finishing off kills. in combination with [T.Racer](item_996e13d5-9521-4312-944f-d672f528776b) it allows yo to finish kills from greater distances as well. If you're not good at quick melee with tracer, this is not the build for you. the rest of things to do with weapon power are weak or cope for skill which could be another power to get more damage.\n\nyou should be using quick melee to start/finish kills after a blink or if you're close to them just use it to finish them if yo run out of ammo (keep in mind you still have to blink and you only have 1 second to hit it).",
